$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tm2fzbw  LOC_AFTER=?

* The loop of a guarded dropping scan: an instantiation of ~ tm2hwrd , whose invariant is indexed by the part of the word still to be popped --- nothing is accumulated, because nothing is pushed.  Lean: the induction in ` zeroIfBorrow_loop ` .

